{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302620","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302620","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130262001:1":{"text":"응, 붉은 모래 거미 지역 곳곳에 다 있다고 생각하면 돼.","source_cn":"是的，赤沙蛛域里到处都是这些家伙。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDA684E4AB246C778","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130262002:1":{"text":"거미들은 수적 우위를 이용해서 지나가는 모든 것을 잡아먹어!","source_cn":"依靠数量优势，它们可以捕食任何经过的东西！任何！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x453EBB1D3B5A0D16","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130262003:1":{"text":"붉은 모래 거미 지역이라고 불리는 이유가 바로 이 때문이지.","source_cn":"也正是因为它们的存在，这里才被称为赤沙蛛域。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4813ED7D0F8E6639","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血姆雷特":{"text":"물릿","source":"蛮血姆雷特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}